# C3: the std submodules mlmf-awq may name. Grows one commit at a time,
# each entry landing beside the code that forced it.
#
# `borrow` -- `std::borrow::Cow`, in `layer.rs`'s test module only
#   (`FakeContainer::tensor_bytes`'s `Result<Cow<'_, [u8]>>` return type,
#   matching `mlmf_core::TensorContainer::tensor_bytes`'s own signature).
# `error`  -- `impl std::error::Error for AwqConfigError`/`LocateError`.
# `fmt`    -- `impl std::fmt::Display for AwqConfigError`/`LocateError`,
#   hand-written rather than derived because the message is free text the
#   caller should see as-is.
borrow
error
fmt
